“Well Jimmy — can I call you Jim? — I like to say I was in the right place at the right time. There were other reporters who were too skeptical, too skittish, but I dove headfirst into this investigation. When a whistleblower reached out to me, I knew it was my duty as a journalist to share this scandal with the world.” 
